  "title": "Bacalao a la Vizcaina (Basque-Style Codfish Stew)",
  "description": "Bacalao (salted cod) is simmered in a wine-based tomato sauce with boiled eggs, potatoes, and olives in this Puerto Rican version of Basque fish stew.",
  "authors": [
    "Milly Suazo-Martinez"
